{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Root cause (confirmed from history): ADR 0085 kept the live module out of `make test` only through `-m \"not integration and not external\"`; no selection ever excluded `live` itself. Commit 504b85c324f (\"Run the integration tier in make test\", 2026-11-01, bug a8af-ac33-74aa-4ccd) added `pytest -m integration` to `make test` for CI parity, which pulled the whole `[integration, live]` module back into every local run. Only `test_delete_permission_probe` (`@_requires_live`) reaches Jira; the other 15 tests in the module are deterministic and execute in CI today.\n\nSecond production-reaching test found: `tests/interfaces/facades/test_cli.py::test_bridge_preview_against_live_jira` is `integration` (not `live`) and runs a live Jira dry-run whenever `acli` and `JIRA_PROJECT` are present.\n\nPlan (mirrors how `external` is kept out: a marker exclusion applied identically locally and in CI):\n1. Move the `live` mark from module scope onto the credential-backed tests only (the delete probe and the bridge preview), so `live` means \"reaches a real Jira\".\n2. Integration tier becomes `-m \"integration and not live\"` in both the Makefile `test` recipe and `_build-and-test.yml`, so parity holds. CI loses no executed coverage: both excluded tests always skip in CI (no credentials, no acli).\n3. `scripts/run_live_matrix.py` selects the matrix by file path (drop `-m live`) so the d01e report keeps all 16 cases.\n4. Opt-in stays `pytest <path> -m live` with credentials; update the module docstring, the `live` marker text, ADR 0085 note, runbook, docs and AGENTS.md.\n5. Collect-only test: the `make test` selections AND `live` collect nothing with JIRA_URL/JIRA_USER/JIRA_API_TOKEN set to placeholders."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793811778733966001,"uuid":"48dfea60-7586-493c-bde8-18533c83b7ab"}